    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, this is just a shoddy plank of wood. What makes it sell for fifty whole pounds?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, sir, you'll want to learn something new today. This is no ordinary piece of wood. It's a blessing of Kjeragandr, Goddess of the Snow Realm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all thanks to Her protection that Kjerag could be free from the Catastrophes and set down roots here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the stuff that made this charm comes from the evergreen trees of Mount Jungfrau, our own second-highest peak in all of Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know much about Jungfrau? Legends say, it's a mountain formed from the tears of Kjeragandr as they fell and froze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The trees watered in that snow from on high grow full with Kjeragandr's love and favor for this land, and charms made from that timber assure your safety and warding of calamity where you may go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as it's your first time here in Kjerag, why not take some souvenirs for your homefolk back in Victoria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What gives you that idea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, these last two years, Mr. Enciodes has had more and more of these big corporate whosits flocking in. I heard your accent and I knew straight away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "To new people like you, see, I recommend these charms in particular to mark the occasion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heard of the Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4, maybe? They're people-eating beasts deep in our mountains. Sinister to the eye, inhuman, there and gone again when you least expect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But so long as you're wearing this charm, blessed by the Vine-Bead Court, you'll cower those things under Kjeragandr's might, and they won't harm you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "And just think, you take it back to your family and tell them, this charm bears the divine protection of Kjerag's Mount Karlan. Paints the complete picture, doesn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've tripped halfway across the land to Kjerag. You wouldn't go back to your own without something nice for it, would you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Bah, fine. I'll take one, and one for my wife and little tot each!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the ticket! If only we could all be straightforward as you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see\u2014sorry, this wood must've been stripped from any random mountain tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_173_slchan_1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh\u2014What gives you the right to say that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, without approval from the Paleroches, no one's even allowed to climb Jungfrau.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Second, I sure didn't hear about anyone climbing her while I was gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I left Kjerag, I even told Weiss, if anyone makes it up her, be sure to send me a message.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know who...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a minute, that tail... you can't be Miss Ensia?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ensia... y\u2014you're Mr. Enciodes's sister?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh-huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, hold it, sir, were you actually trying to swindle me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, hahahah, they said Miss Ensia loved climbing ever since she was little. Seems she knows more about the snowcaps than us commoners after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these wares of mine came from the hunters in the mountains, actually. They must have been the ones swindling me, no doubt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be going to find them and settle our score!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for this charm... Miss Ensia, would you mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true it has the Vine-Bead Court's blessing. No man of Kjerag would dare to forge that seal and offend Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to ward off any rumored Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4s with it, forget it. But if you take it back as a souvenir, I think it'll work great.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, just slash that price a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff... in light of that, I'll put them at ten pounds a piece! Now, sir, are you still buying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If the sister of Mr. Enciodes says as much, I've got no reason to be skeptical.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Business for you must be tough. I'll take five of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Business-Tripping Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming right up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you here to buy anything, Miss Ensia? Whatever you fancy, it's yours. My business owes itself to the Silverashes, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, I'll pay you like normal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#10$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Of course.;Lucky we prepared enough Victorian and Kazimierz cash.;You couldn't just take stuff? It's your clan's territory.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jeez, we could exchange all we want, but it's still only worth anything in our family's region.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this trade port's doing the hottest business anywhere in our land. You may as well spend all that money right here. You'll still get away with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, c'mon, Doctor. Other people have to make a living too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you really want, we can go see what my brother says about it. He'd get things sorted out sweet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_198_blackd_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Ensia, we should be on our way to the station by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, we're tight on time. Doctor, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The blizzard is coming. Take caution, outsider.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "And you are?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't want to freeze, leaving now will still save your skin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you blanking for, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Someone was talking to me.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? There's nobody here, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_173_slchan_1#3$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's far from the right season for leisurely outdoor coffee."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowstormflp",
