    {
        "text": "You look behind you, and only see the bright canopy blocking the sun, and a sign advertising Karlan Trade."
    },
    {
        "text": "A deserted terrace sits silent, just like the distant peaks of pure white."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it was the pages of the magazine on the table, rustling in the wind, that gave you the illusion someone was sitting next to you, talking to you."
    },
