    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Matterhorn! You're here. The Master's waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good to see you, Weiss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was going to, but the Master wants to invite the Doctor to the Tri-Clan Council with him, and have me stay back to greet them in your place. After all, I'm an employee of Rhodes Island myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I think you must be ready for a vacation after guarding the Young Lady for so long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, given you're out here, I'm guessing she ditched you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, yes. She's shopping with the Doctor right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She wanted a vacation for me too, so she had me let her free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the Master and the Young Lady for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well? How do you feel, being back this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The territory's been fast with construction, and huge in its overall change. It's almost unrecognizable already. That's the Master for you, indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take the two of them up on their great kindness and visit home for now, see my parents, and then I'll be on standby at the Master's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been away for a while too. Last time we met, weren't you off with the Master to Columbia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got nothing pressing. Savoring the streets again is more than enough for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about that old Itra friend of yours? Monch, I think, was the name. Eat a bite with him if you have the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...We'll see, I guess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
