    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_422_aurora_1#1$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hear you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Brilliant! It looks like the base station's signal is fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've found a few suitable hidden spots for the comms station installation. But no matter where we install a station in Turicum, we won't be able to catch all of Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Kjerag's southern gateway, and practically its only contact channel with the outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Setting up a comms network here has massive importance, but if you want to cover the whole of Kjerag, setting up a few more simple stations around the central lake region would be the best option.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what I'm asking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "...? Didn't you have me wandering outside so I could scope things for us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What I mean is, you haven't been back in Kjerag for a long time. How do you feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, it feels totally unbelievable. When I left Kjerag under the Silverashes' talent fostering program, it was from here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then, even Turicum was just an ordinary little village, let alone the rail station at the border now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought it'd become so big. At this point, I think you could argue it stands up to the cities on the outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doing construction work like this in the snowy mountains must be harder than I could ever imagine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you all right now, Captain? I'll come find you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're boarding a train to Karlan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to come with yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mentioned your home was in an industrial area, in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For now, go back and visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing's more important than family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're back in the mountains. It's the perfect opportunity to head for home. The Doctor thinks so, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did the Doctor say that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand. If you're okay with it, then I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, the Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aurora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_252",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor has me with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
