    },
    {
        "text": "With a steam whistle and a faint announcement, the train departing for Karlan sets slowly into motion."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "24_i02",
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "xScale": 2,
        "yScale": 2,
        "x": -300,
        "y": -100
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 2,
        "yScaleTo": 2,
        "duration": 10,
        "xTo": -180,
        "yTo": -100,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, let me tell you about the names of all these peaks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look. The one there with the flat-ish slope is Jungfrau. The third Saintess named that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "text": "The really steep one there, that's Matterhorn. His name actually came straight from that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ensia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ensia continues on, with something to say about all the scenery that passes by, and all that Kjerag is."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
