        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "24_i02",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "xScale": 2,
        "yScale": 2,
        "x": 400,
        "y": -100
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 2,
        "yScaleTo": 2,
        "duration": 10,
        "xTo": 280,
        "yTo": -100,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alternately, you listen to Ensia, and cast your gaze out of the window."
    },
    {
        "text": "Outside, remnants of ice drift in a lake reflecting the blue sky. Some locals are together at its shallows, some drawing water, some doing their laundry, some laughing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The purest white snowpeaks stand imposingly tall, any attempt to lift your head and see their end blocked by the sunlight."
    },
    {
        "text": "Halfway up, where the mountains level somewhat, a young shepherd herds flocks of stockbeasts home. No surprise crosses him as he sees the people aboard the train; instead, he lifts his whip, waving at you in greeting."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not far away is the village where he lives, smoke spiraling from chimneys, peaceful and prosperous."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
